1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,750
For thirty days, I did one thing

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:03,870
every morning.

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,490
I hung from a bar.

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,540
That's it.

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,810
No pull-ups.

6
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:08,970
No weights.

7
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,150
Just hanging.

8
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,260
You trained for a month by doing

9
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,260
nothing?

10
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,300
Basically.

11
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,810
And on day fourteen,

12
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:18,230
something happened that I didn't expect.

13
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:19,490
Stay for that one.

14
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:20,560
Day one.

15
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,690
I lasted twenty-two seconds.

16
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,390
My hands burned, my fingers opened by

17
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,290
themselves, and I dropped.

18
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,260
Here's why.

19
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,500
A dead hang is a grip test.

20
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,030
Your forearm muscles hold your whole body

21
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,630
weight, and most people never train them.

22
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:37,750
Day seven.

23
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,970
Forty seconds.

24
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,420
My forearms were sore every morning,

25
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,110
like after a heavy workout.

26
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,240
That's the muscles that close your fingers,

27
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:48,540
working harder than they ever have.

28
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,620
So you're getting stronger by hanging out.

29
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,750
Literally.

30
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,660
Day fourteen.

31
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,180
Here's the surprise.

32
00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:59,940
My lower back, which hurt every evening

33
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:02,060
from sitting, stopped hurting.

34
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:04,920
When you hang, gravity gently pulls your

35
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,350
spine longer, and the muscles around it

36
00:01:07,350 --> 00:01:08,270
relax.

37
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,040
It feels like a stretch from the

38
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,130
inside.

39
00:01:11,230 --> 00:01:13,280
It's not a cure for back pain.

40
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:14,900
But after a day at a desk,

41
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,550
it felt amazing.

42
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:18,070
Day twenty-one.

43
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:19,790
One full minute.

44
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:21,600
And my shoulders stopped clicking when I

45
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,820
lifted my arms.

46
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:26,460
Hanging opens up your shoulders and stretches

47
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:28,330
the muscles that get tight from hunching

48
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:29,400
over a phone.

49
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,730
Day thirty.

50
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:32,970
One minute and thirty seconds.

51
00:01:32,970 --> 00:01:35,320
Four times longer than day one.

52
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:38,500
My grip got much stronger.

53
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:40,220
Jars open easily.

54
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,210
Carrying groceries is nothing.

55
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:44,180
And my forearms look thicker.

56
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:46,000
Pull-ups felt easier too,

57
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,430
because my hands didn't quit first anymore.

58
00:01:48,530 --> 00:01:49,710
If you want to try it,

59
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,670
grab a bar with your hands shoulder

60
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:52,650
width apart.

61
00:01:52,730 --> 00:01:54,910
Arms straight, shoulders relaxed,

62
00:01:54,910 --> 00:01:56,150
and just hang.

63
00:01:57,050 --> 00:01:58,930
Do three hangs, as long as you

64
00:01:58,930 --> 00:01:59,620
can.

65
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:02,090
Add five seconds every few days.

66
00:02:02,190 --> 00:02:03,420
If your hands slip,

67
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:05,020
use a towel or chalk.

68
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:06,260
If your shoulders hurt,

69
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,860
keep your feet on a chair and

70
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:08,990
take some weight off.

71
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:11,140
How long can you hang right now?

72
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:13,110
Test it today, and comment your time.
